 "changed_since_previous": "Added explicit error handling and tests to reject `keypath_only` if passed to `fundrawtransaction`, and added a release note.",
 "card": "Adds a keypath_only option to send, sendall, walletcreatefundedpsbt, walletprocesspsbt, and descriptorprocesspsbt to restrict Taproot spending to key paths. When enabled, the signing and PSBT filling logic will not add script-path data, will not produce script-path signatures, and will refuse to finalize script paths. This prevents accidental on-chain disclosure of fallback branches (such as in MuSig2 descriptors with timelocked recovery scripts), avoids paying higher script-path fees unnecessarily, and avoids triggering firmware bugs in hardware signing devices.",
